    {
      "title": "Ready Endpoints",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Ready Endpoints。選択期間の実測値。イベント指標はイベント発生前に系列が存在しない場合があります。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "bdy6m43uy9ybkd"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(cilium_endpoint_state{endpoint_state=\"ready\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "interval": "1m"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
